body.rn:
Paulo yari afitaniye urukundo n'abakristo bashasha. Yari kuri bo:

- **nk'umuvyeyi akunda** yitaho ibibondo vyiwe (1 Abatesalonika 2 : 7);
- **nk'umugenzi** abaha Ubutumwa Bwiza, akabaha n'ubuzima bwiwe nyene (2 : 8);
- **nk'umuvyeyi w'umugabo** aremesha, ahoza kandi ahanura abana biwe ngo bagende uko bibereye Imana (2 : 11-12).

Yari kandi akarorero: bacitse abigana biwe n'ab'Umwami (1 : 6).
